          "text": "14",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Loto ali'sampwa na ku'komolwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha itungo lyeni'lo kwav'age na idale li'mo lya v'atemi v'ane: Amulafeli mutemi wa ku' Shinali, Alioko mutemi wa ku' Elasali, Kedolaoma mutemi wa ku' Elamu na Tidali mutemi wa ku' Goimu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "v'ose ku' haki'mo v'ayaga ku'kalasana wu'lu'gu' na idale lya wu'v'i'li' lya v'atemi v'atano: Bela mutemi wa ku' Sodoma, Bilisha mutemi wa ku' Gomola, Shinabu mutemi wa ku' Adima, Shemebeli mutemi wa ku' Seboimu na mutemi wa ku' Bela. Lina li'ngi' lya Bela hu' Soali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'ose v'agasangyaga madale gav'o ga v'asilikale ku' haki'mo ku' Iwonde lya Sidimu, ku' lina li'ngi' Iwonde lya Nyanza ya Munyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I'li' idale lya v'enav'a v'atemi v'atano v'av'ezyaga vyeni'vyo ku'nguno ku' itungo lya myaka iku'mi na iv'i'li' v'av'age v'atemilwe na mutemi Kedolaoma, ali'vi ha mwaka gwa iku'mi na idatu' v'amutalaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaka gwa iku'mi na ine Kedolaoma na v'atemi v'iye, av'o v'a idale lya v'atemi v'ane, v'ayaga ku'kigu'ma wu'lu'gu' na idale lyeni'li' lya v'atemi v'atano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wav'age akaali' ku'lasana wu'lu'gu' nav'o, mutemi Kedolaoma haki'mo na v'atemi v'iye v'ayaga mbela ku'kigu'ma wu'lu'gu' na ku'v'akinda V'alefai ku' Ashitaloti-kalinaimu, V'azuzi ku' Hamu, V'aemi ku' Shawe-kiliataimu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na V'aholi v'a ku' ngu'lu' zyav'o zya Seili. V'av'apeezyaga mpaka ku' El-palani, ku' ndugo ya ibalangu'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho v'asu'v'aga ku' nnuma, na v'afikaga ku' En-mishipati, lina li'ngi' hu' Kadeshi, v'avikindaga vyalo vyose vya V'aamaleki, na V'aamoli av'o v'av'age v'ikazi v'a Hasason-tamali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho v'atemi av'o v'ane v'a Sodoma, Gomola, Adima, Seboimu, na Bela, lina li'ngi' Soali, v'awonaga v'iv'ange wu'lu'gu' kwenu'ko ku' iwonde lya Sidimu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ki'gele v'alasane wu'lu'gu' na Kedolaoma mutemi wa Elamu, Tidali wa Goimu, Amulafeli wa Shinali, na Alioko wa Elasali. Wav'age wu'lu'gu' wa v'atemi v'ane ku' v'atemi v'atano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nsi' ya Iwonde lya Sidimu yav'age na miina mingi ago gokalile lami, nav'o v'atemi v'a Sodoma na Gomola aho v'apeelaga wu'lu'gu', v'amo v'adumbu'ki'laga mu miina genago na v'angi' v'apeelelaga mu ngu'lu'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'enav'o v'atemi v'ane aho v'akindaga v'asampaga nsawo zyose zya kaya zya Sodoma na Gomola haki'mo na viliwa vyav'o vyose, haho v'awu'kaga ku'ya ku' wav'o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'amusampaga na Loto, mwana wa mudu'gu'ye na Abulamu, u'yo wav'age mwikazi wa Sodoma, v'ayaga nawe haki'mo na nsawo zyakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu' yu'mo watyegaga na wamufili'laga mmola Abulamu, Muebulania, itungo lyeni'lo wav'age mwikazi wa bi'hi' na miti' mihanya zyamwa Mamule, Muamoli, u'yo wav'age mudu'gu'ye na Eshikoli na Aneli. V'ose v'av'age na lu'sangi' na Abulamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abulamu aho wigagwa mmola ku'v'a mwana wa mudu'gu'ye wasampagwa, wav'av'ilingaga v'antu' magana adatu' na iku'mi na munane av'o v'av'yali'lilwe ha wakwe na v'ahembekilwe kwigu'ma wu'lu'gu', haho v'av'alondaga v'anisi mpaka ku' kaya ya Dani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha wu'ziku', Abulamu wagagawu'laga madale ga v'asilikale ki'gele v'av'agwi'li'le v'anisi v'av'o. Nav'o v'av'agu'maga, v'av'akindaga, na ku'v'apeezya mpaka ku' kaya ya Hoba, ku' sukuma ya kaya ya Damasiko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Abulamu wasu'v'yaga nsawo zyose zya Sodoma na Gomola i'zyo ndi' zyasampwa na v'anisi, na wamusu'v'yaga Loto, mwana wa mudu'gu'ye, na nsawo zyakwe haki'mo na v'aki'ma na v'antu' v'angi'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Melikizedeki ali'mudosya Abulamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abulamu aho wasu'v'aga ku'fuma ku' wu'lu'gu' na ku'mukinda mutemi Kedolaoma haki'mo na v'atemi v'iye, mutemi wa Sodoma wafumaga ku'kamusu'mbi'la ku' Iwonde lya Shawe, lina li'ngi' Iwonde lya Mutemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Melikizedeki mutemi wa kaya ya Salemu, u'yo wav'age muhozya wa Mulungu wa ha igu'lya muno, waletaga mugate na ki'neneko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho wamudosyaga ku' ku'yomba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe Abulamu wamupaga Melikizedeki ifungu lya iku'mi lya vintu' i'vyo wasampaga ku' wu'lu'gu'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Mutemi wa Sodoma wamuwi'laga Abulamu, “Mpage v'antu' v'anne, ali'vi nsawo zyeni'zyo zyose u'sole ev'e mweni'ki'li'.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sumbwa Abulamu wasu'v'yaga, “Nu'wu'sya mukono gwanne na ku'lahi'la ku' lina lyamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu wa ha igu'lya muno, matunda wa ilunde na welelo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nkav'ile ku'sola wu'zi, ninga mukov'a gwa ki'latu' ninga ki'ntu' ki'mo cha ku' wako, ku'du' wize wifune ati' wakansav'ya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkav'ile ku'sola ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo sumbwa du' i'vyo v'antu' v'anne v'alile. Hangi' Aneli, Eshikoli na Mamule, v'antu' av'o v'isangizye nanne ku' wu'lu'gu', v'apiwe ifungu ki'ti' i'vi yi'li'koov'iwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
